WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.976
The rat smells the cheese on the table.

2
00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:15.159
He will eat it in his hole.

3
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:24.559
The dog buries the bone in the yard.

4
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.210
He will eat it later.

5
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:37.228
The bird pulls the worm from the ground.

6
00:00:37.229 --> 00:00:41.930
She will feed it to her babies.

7
00:00:41.931 --> 00:00:47.715
The rabbit pulls the carrot from the ground.

8
00:00:47.716 --> 00:00:54.184
He will share it with his friend.

9
00:00:54.185 --> 00:01:01.030
The squirrel stores the nuts in the trunk.

10
00:01:01.031 --> 00:01:07.007
She will eat them this winter.

11
00:01:07.008 --> 00:01:14.277
The bear catches the fish in the stream.

12
00:01:14.278 --> 00:01:20.954
She will take them to her cub.

13
00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:26.052
The frog eats the fly in the air.

14
00:01:26.053 --> 00:01:31.636
The frog is still hungry.

15
00:01:31.637 --> 00:01:35.762
Yummy!

16
00:01:35.763 --> 00:01:40.487
What will you eat now?

